# WS1-02. Source: spec/04-expressions.md §2 (C precedence and associativity minus
# the comma; ?: right-associative), §5 (arithmetic >> on signed, logical on
# unsigned; relational yields bool) and spec/02-types.md §10. Values computed by
# hand with C precedence: 7, 12, 2, 1<<3=8, 1|(6^(3&5))=7, -6, -1>>28=-1,
# 0xFFFFFFFF>>28=15, f?1:(t?2:3)=2, 10-2-((3*2)%4)=6, true, (1<2)==true.
expect: output
contrast: 20 - 5 - 3 ==> 20 - (5 - 3)
contrast-expect: output
--- output
7
12
2
8
7
-6
-1
15
2
6
true
true
